00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:10,510
Millimeter length unit.

2
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:24,270
Observe the image of the straight ruler, pay attention to the millimeter division marks.

3
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:41,740
Millimeter is a length unit.

4
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:47,820
Millimeter is abbreviated as:

5
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:55,760
1 cm = 10 mm;

6
00:00:58,490 --> 00:01:04,170
1 dm = 100 mm;

7
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:11,320
1 m = 1000 mm

8
00:01:17,020 --> 00:01:20,270
Observe the picture and answer the question.

9
00:01:23,540 --> 00:01:28,380
How many millimeters is line segment AB long?

10
00:01:30,020 --> 00:01:35,140
How many millimeters is line segment CD long?

11
00:01:39,570 --> 00:01:45,980
